(4943206, 719107, 29777, '<td valign="top">This is frightening. It looks like a product shot for a mortuary. You have captured the doll in a very lifelike (or deathlike) pose. They say death sells.</td>', 'This is frightening. It looks like a product shot for a mortuary. You have captured the doll in a very lifelike (or deathlike) pose. They say death sells.', '2008-09-08 21:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943216, 718852, 29777, '<td valign="top">Lots of dust and nicks can be seen. Excellent lighting and DOF.</td>', 'Lots of dust and nicks can be seen. Excellent lighting and DOF.', '2008-09-08 21:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943226, 719211, 70265, '<td valign="top">great bokeh!</td>', 'great bokeh!', '2008-09-08 21:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943239, 719157, 29777, '<td valign="top">very clever. This would make a wonderful ad campaign. I can''t really decide whether I like the way the light falls off inside the bottle. On one hand it helps direct the eye to the logo. On the other hand I also want to see the entire bottle.</td>', 'very clever. This would make a wonderful ad campaign. I can''t really decide whether I like the way the light falls off inside the bottle. On one hand it helps direct the eye to the logo. On the other hand I also want to see the entire bottle.', '2008-09-08 21:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943242, 718778, 29777, '<td valign="top">The blue carpet is casting a blue shadow on the white part of the dog.</td>', 'The blue carpet is casting a blue shadow on the white part of the dog.', '2008-09-08 21:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943246, 719125, 29777, '<td valign="top">Very clever. I can''t help but think the flame covering the label is a mistake that the ad execs would not like. The rest of the lighting is excellent.</td>', 'Very clever. I can''t help but think the flame covering the label is a mistake that the ad execs would not like. The rest of the lighting is excellent.', '2008-09-08 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943251, 719143, 29777, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but I want to see more of the numbers on the dial of the subject.</td>', 'I really like this shot, but I want to see more of the numbers on the dial of the subject.', '2008-09-08 22:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943252, 719042, 29777, '<td valign="top">simple and well done.</td>', 'simple and well done.', '2008-09-08 22:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943254, 719099, 45524, '<td valign="top">You need to look into getting a book called Light, Science Magic. Its an amazing book that teaches how to shoot very reflective surfaces, by teaching about angles of reflections and lighting techniques. You have really lost too much detail in the front ratchet.</td>', 'You need to look into getting a book called Light, Science Magic. Its an amazing book that teaches how to shoot very reflective surfaces, by teaching about angles of reflections and lighting techniques. You have really lost too much detail in the front ratchet.', '2008-09-08 22:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943260, 718559, 45524, '<td valign="top">Very Nice product shot. Although I wishe there was a bit more detail in the underside rather then darker shadows. The low angle shows the area, but there isnt any detail there.</td>', 'Very Nice product shot. Although I wishe there was a bit more detail in the underside rather then darker shadows. The low angle shows the area, but there isnt any detail there.', '2008-09-08 22:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943264, 719173, 29777, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. I like the reflection and the selective color. The dust spots, the tilted steering wheel and the inconsistent seat latches are distracting.</td>', 'Clever idea. I like the reflection and the selective color. The dust spots, the tilted steering wheel and the inconsistent seat latches are distracting.', '2008-09-08 22:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943273, 718662, 45524, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a touch off, there is not detail in the correct rocks.</td>', 'Focus seems a touch off, there is not detail in the correct rocks.', '2008-09-08 22:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943276, 718185, 45524, '<td valign="top">Product shots would normally not have selective focus. The main idea is to show the whole product.</td>', 'Product shots would normally not have selective focus. The main idea is to show the whole product.', '2008-09-08 22:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4943280, 719213, 45524, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit harsh, and I''m not sure what the actual product is.</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit harsh, and I''m not sure what the actual product is.', '2008-09-08 22:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
