(4944372, 718845, 33672, '<td valign="top">My son''s favorite! Nice change of pace. lighitng is good albiet a bit of fill flash or side lighting would''ve softened the shadows.</td>', 'My son''s favorite! Nice change of pace. lighitng is good albiet a bit of fill flash or side lighting would''ve softened the shadows.', '2008-09-09 12:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
