(4952293, 718873, 60658, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement and creation of atmosphere.  Selective focus is right on.  Light from the left is a little harsh - see winner of double take II for a sample of how I would have liked to see the light here.  Still one of my favorites.</td>', 'Nice arrangement and creation of atmosphere.  Selective focus is right on.  Light from the left is a little harsh - see winner of double take II for a sample of how I would have liked to see the light here.  Still one of my favorites.', '2008-09-12 14:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
