(4952408, 717989, 60658, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  The preparation to complete this scene really made a difference. Might get some complaints for cutoff reflections, but this is trivial and it still looks great.  Front page for sure!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  The preparation to complete this scene really made a difference. Might get some complaints for cutoff reflections, but this is trivial and it still looks great.  Front page for sure!', '2008-09-12 16:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952414, 719116, 60658, '<td valign="top">Nice set-up, interesting reflections.  Just too soft.</td>', 'Nice set-up, interesting reflections.  Just too soft.', '2008-09-12 16:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952440, 719231, 41479, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan!</td>', 'I''m a fan!', '2008-09-12 16:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952469, 718448, 43774, '<td valign="top">Pretty good lighting and a simple, straightforward product shot. At first I thought I was seeing a reflection but now I see it is a tall vase. Not so sure I like the fact that it is cut off.</td>', 'Pretty good lighting and a simple, straightforward product shot. At first I thought I was seeing a reflection but now I see it is a tall vase. Not so sure I like the fact that it is cut off.', '2008-09-12 16:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952470, 719119, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice colour but looks a bit dull to me. I like the composition.</td>', 'Nice colour but looks a bit dull to me. I like the composition.', '2008-09-12 16:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952474, 718887, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear, the nuts look tasty and fresh, good for an ad. Not so sure I like the background material though.</td>', 'Very clear, the nuts look tasty and fresh, good for an ad. Not so sure I like the background material though.', '2008-09-12 16:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952475, 719117, 43774, '<td valign="top">It looks oversharpened to me, but that could just be high contrast I am seeing. I like the blue and the black background.</td>', 'It looks oversharpened to me, but that could just be high contrast I am seeing. I like the blue and the black background.', '2008-09-12 16:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952476, 719149, 43774, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, good lighting, not so sure about that smoke.</td>', 'Dramatic, good lighting, not so sure about that smoke.', '2008-09-12 16:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952477, 719160, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and colour.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and colour.', '2008-09-12 16:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952482, 717194, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear, great macro, this thing looks huge. Not so sure about this particular angle, I can see an edge above the "20" in the tiny window...makes it look as if it is defective or falling down, not something you''d want to portray in a product shot. But that is just a nit-pick.</td>', 'Very clear, great macro, this thing looks huge. Not so sure about this particular angle, I can see an edge above the "20" in the tiny window...makes it look as if it is defective or falling down, not something you''d want to portray in a product shot. But that is just a nit-pick.', '2008-09-12 16:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952486, 719225, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very clear, good lighting. Is that dust on the strap? Might not be ideal for a product shot.</td>', 'Very clear, good lighting. Is that dust on the strap? Might not be ideal for a product shot.', '2008-09-12 16:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952512, 719026, 67237, '<td valign="top">The 3 pairs on the right side seem to be a bit out of focus. <br/>Not crazy about the multichromatic border.</td>', 'The 3 pairs on the right side seem to be a bit out of focus. Not crazy about the multichromatic border.', '2008-09-12 17:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952561, 719079, 60658, '<td valign="top">Nice color and detail.  Not sure if the close crop works for me, like it in theory, hmm.  I think the sole of boots tell a lot about their purpose, so if you could see the rugged tread, it would demonstrate the name of the boot better.</td>', 'Nice color and detail.  Not sure if the close crop works for me, like it in theory, hmm.  I think the sole of boots tell a lot about their purpose, so if you could see the rugged tread, it would demonstrate the name of the boot better.', '2008-09-12 17:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952564, 719209, 60658, '<td valign="top">Lighting, perspective and color are great.  Hand touching the bag is a little distracting.  One of my top choices.</td>', 'Lighting, perspective and color are great.  Hand touching the bag is a little distracting.  One of my top choices.', '2008-09-12 17:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952566, 718833, 60658, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Product has great lines, so good choice!  Lighting is well done without distracting hotspots!</td>', 'Very nice.  Product has great lines, so good choice!  Lighting is well done without distracting hotspots!', '2008-09-12 17:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952581, 719071, 60658, '<td valign="top">While I would eat this cake like the fatty I am, it does not really appeal to my senses.  Color on "party" is good, but the chocolate doesn''t look rich or tasty.  Maybe cutting a slice out to show a bit of the cake and not just the frosting would be nice.</td>', 'While I would eat this cake like the fatty I am, it does not really appeal to my senses.  Color on "party" is good, but the chocolate doesn''t look rich or tasty.  Maybe cutting a slice out to show a bit of the cake and not just the frosting would be nice.', '2008-09-12 18:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952584, 719140, 60658, '<td valign="top">Like the contrasting background color and limited DOF, but whatever is behind the bottle is distracting! Text on bottle should be sharper as well.  Nice shot overall.</td>', 'Like the contrasting background color and limited DOF, but whatever is behind the bottle is distracting! Text on bottle should be sharper as well.  Nice shot overall.', '2008-09-12 18:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952588, 719024, 60658, '<td valign="top">Great shot, makes me want to hit the beach ASAP!  Limited DOF works perfectly and color is not too overdone.</td>', 'Great shot, makes me want to hit the beach ASAP!  Limited DOF works perfectly and color is not too overdone.', '2008-09-12 18:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952589, 719138, 43774, '<td valign="top">So clear, I feel as if I could reach out and touch them. Very pretty, I love the colours.</td>', 'So clear, I feel as if I could reach out and touch them. Very pretty, I love the colours.', '2008-09-12 18:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952590, 718956, 60658, '<td valign="top">Nice glass.  Lighting is harsh in some areas, bottom left, top center, detracting from the colors of the glass.</td>', 'Nice glass.  Lighting is harsh in some areas, bottom left, top center, detracting from the colors of the glass.', '2008-09-12 18:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952597, 718159, 60658, '<td valign="top">Hungry already!  Very nice presentation, might be a bit more interesting if the last shrimp in the line were displayed to see the curl of the body.  I am thinking of how some specialty sushi rolls come with the last slice oriented differently than the rest of the roll with the tail of the shrimp sticking up.  Just a thought.</td>', 'Hungry already!  Very nice presentation, might be a bit more interesting if the last shrimp in the line were displayed to see the curl of the body.  I am thinking of how some specialty sushi rolls come with the last slice oriented differently than the rest of the roll with the tail of the shrimp sticking up.  Just a thought.', '2008-09-12 18:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952600, 718754, 60658, '<td valign="top">Two bottles! Looks like a good time.  Great shot - limited DOF works great, composition and lighting too.</td>', 'Two bottles! Looks like a good time.  Great shot - limited DOF works great, composition and lighting too.', '2008-09-12 18:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952607, 718484, 60658, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and tones.</td>', 'Nice lighting and tones.', '2008-09-12 18:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952646, 718662, 60658, '<td valign="top">Ah, great idea.  Hard to tell that those are diamonds though.  I do not shoot jewelery but notice that diamonds are frequently photographed on white backgrounds.  A tighter crop would show them off better too.</td>', 'Ah, great idea.  Hard to tell that those are diamonds though.  I do not shoot jewelery but notice that diamonds are frequently photographed on white backgrounds.  A tighter crop would show them off better too.', '2008-09-12 19:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952698, 718716, 60658, '<td valign="top">Sharp Product, not so sharp shot.  Not sure if this occurred in the saving process...</td>', 'Sharp Product, not so sharp shot.  Not sure if this occurred in the saving process...', '2008-09-12 19:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952734, 719078, 60658, '<td valign="top">While these look yummy, the side lighting isn''t working for me.  Image lacks contrast in the the midtones.</td>', 'While these look yummy, the side lighting isn''t working for me.  Image lacks contrast in the the midtones.', '2008-09-12 20:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952740, 718969, 60658, '<td valign="top">Reflection is very cool.  Would have like to seen the emblem a little brighter to make it stand out against the paint and draw the eye to it.</td>', 'Reflection is very cool.  Would have like to seen the emblem a little brighter to make it stand out against the paint and draw the eye to it.', '2008-09-12 20:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952742, 718496, 60658, '<td valign="top">First impression was wow!  But inspection of the smoke coming out of the mouth is bothersome - just something weird about it.  Other than that, one of my top choices!</td>', 'First impression was wow!  But inspection of the smoke coming out of the mouth is bothersome - just something weird about it.  Other than that, one of my top choices!', '2008-09-12 20:16:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4952744, 718703, 60658, '<td valign="top">Interesting display and use of limited DOF.  Reflection on left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Interesting display and use of limited DOF.  Reflection on left is a bit distracting.', '2008-09-12 20:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952745, 718999, 60658, '<td valign="top">Like the look of the bike on the black backdrop.</td>', 'Like the look of the bike on the black backdrop.', '2008-09-12 20:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952746, 718058, 60658, '<td valign="top">Cute pose, nice color, lighting is just right!</td>', 'Cute pose, nice color, lighting is just right!', '2008-09-12 20:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952749, 717902, 60658, '<td valign="top">Nice display.  Background is a little bright, even on calibrated monitor.</td>', 'Nice display.  Background is a little bright, even on calibrated monitor.', '2008-09-12 20:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952778, 717893, 62187, '<td valign="top">I can sorta see this in a catalog but maybe just a tad bit tighter shot. ??? I like it overall - the edit is pleasing to me. 9</td>', 'I can sorta see this in a catalog but maybe just a tad bit tighter shot. ??? I like it overall - the edit is pleasing to me. 9', '2008-09-12 20:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952780, 718571, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yeah, sure. I think in a true catalog shot they wouldn''t have used as much distance of focus as you have. I also think there''s too much dead space on the right hand-side. Overall, I''ll go with a 7.</td>', 'Yeah, sure. I think in a true catalog shot they wouldn''t have used as much distance of focus as you have. I also think there''s too much dead space on the right hand-side. Overall, I''ll go with a 7.', '2008-09-12 20:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952783, 718874, 62187, '<td valign="top">The focus is SUPER sharp to me and I can totally see how it fits the challenge. My only suggestion is that it''s possibly too dark. ??? I''ll go with 9</td>', 'The focus is SUPER sharp to me and I can totally see how it fits the challenge. My only suggestion is that it''s possibly too dark. ??? I''ll go with 9', '2008-09-12 20:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952784, 719213, 60658, '<td valign="top">In the first glance of the thumbnails I thought this was going to be different.  Arrangement of boxes to accentuate the words are nice, but the shadows and lighting aren''t so great.  If you only have 1 flash (as I do) you have to find creative ways to bounce light to eliminate distracting shadows.  I have also found that using Model CE-300PDQ lights from Home Depot, with daylight 6500K bulbs work well for a constant light source.</td>', 'In the first glance of the thumbnails I thought this was going to be different.  Arrangement of boxes to accentuate the words are nice, but the shadows and lighting aren''t so great.  If you only have 1 flash (as I do) you have to find creative ways to bounce light to eliminate distracting shadows.  I have also found that using Model CE-300PDQ lights from Home Depot, with daylight 6500K bulbs work well for a constant light source.', '2008-09-12 20:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952786, 718774, 62187, '<td valign="top">A super interesting photo. Am I buying an Umbrella? I think so...</td>', 'A super interesting photo. Am I buying an Umbrella? I think so...', '2008-09-12 20:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952788, 719223, 62187, '<td valign="top">Sweet! You''ve got it down and I can''t offer any truly helpful comments. 10</td>', 'Sweet! You''ve got it down and I can''t offer any truly helpful comments. 10', '2008-09-12 20:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952791, 719138, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s a 10 of a photo but I can''t really see this in a catalog. I don''t look at flower magazines very often. 9</td>', 'It''s a 10 of a photo but I can''t really see this in a catalog. I don''t look at flower magazines very often. 9', '2008-09-12 20:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952792, 719225, 62187, '<td valign="top">A 10 of a photo except for the dust: 9</td>', 'A 10 of a photo except for the dust: 9', '2008-09-12 20:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4952793, 719233, 62187, '<td valign="top">How boring but I totally see this like in the ads that come in the mail or newspaper. 10!</td>', 'How boring but I totally see this like in the ads that come in the mail or newspaper. 10!', '2008-09-12 20:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
