(4954981, 719224, 93094, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  I like the message it displays.  Hanging sheet in the background may have helped cut down the reflections in the bottle.</td>', 'Nice concept.  I like the message it displays.  Hanging sheet in the background may have helped cut down the reflections in the bottle.', '2008-09-14 18:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4954998, 718183, 93094, '<td valign="top">I like what you were going for but I think the focus is a little too much out.  If I didn''t already know this was a Jag in the title I might have a hard time recognizing it.</td>', 'I like what you were going for but I think the focus is a little too much out.  If I didn''t already know this was a Jag in the title I might have a hard time recognizing it.', '2008-09-14 18:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955001, 718469, 93094, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  At first glance I thought it might look better with more crop on the right hand side but after playing with it I think you found the best version.  A little more reflection and sparkle in the diamond would have worked well.</td>', 'Really nice.  At first glance I thought it might look better with more crop on the right hand side but after playing with it I think you found the best version.  A little more reflection and sparkle in the diamond would have worked well.', '2008-09-14 18:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955006, 719114, 93094, '<td valign="top">Great use of props with the shoes.  I would try to make the Dexter name appear wholly and try to cut back the reflection in the ball.  Other than that its a great job.</td>', 'Great use of props with the shoes.  I would try to make the Dexter name appear wholly and try to cut back the reflection in the ball.  Other than that its a great job.', '2008-09-14 19:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955008, 719222, 93094, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, has a very European feel to it.  The brightness of the static works well.</td>', 'Interesting concept, has a very European feel to it.  The brightness of the static works well.', '2008-09-14 19:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955011, 718852, 63006, '<td valign="top">great shot, there are a few spots of dust, tiny scratches, etc, that i would have cleaned up first, but otherwise a gorgeous photo and ad.</td>', 'great shot, there are a few spots of dust, tiny scratches, etc, that i would have cleaned up first, but otherwise a gorgeous photo and ad.', '2008-09-14 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955015, 719150, 93094, '<td valign="top">Great concept now that I get it.  It took me a few views and minutes to get the "kiss" part.  Maybe its me but I don''t think I''ve ever seen a Hershey kiss with a top quite that round.</td>', 'Great concept now that I get it.  It took me a few views and minutes to get the "kiss" part.  Maybe its me but I don''t think I''ve ever seen a Hershey kiss with a top quite that round.', '2008-09-14 19:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955017, 719149, 93094, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  The smoke and diamond really work well together.  There''s something that doesn''t quite sit right with the right side of the diamond, maybe a little more focus.  It almost looks to me like the stone is not symmetrical.</td>', 'Great concept!  The smoke and diamond really work well together.  There''s something that doesn''t quite sit right with the right side of the diamond, maybe a little more focus.  It almost looks to me like the stone is not symmetrical.', '2008-09-14 19:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955021, 719058, 93094, '<td valign="top">I really LOVE this shot but not sure it works for the challenge.  There''s too much other than the jeans going on (which I''m sure you went for), the jeans are not red enough, and she really doesn''t appear like a cowgirl wearing that sweatshirt and tennis shoes.</td>', 'I really LOVE this shot but not sure it works for the challenge.  There''s too much other than the jeans going on (which I''m sure you went for), the jeans are not red enough, and she really doesn''t appear like a cowgirl wearing that sweatshirt and tennis shoes.', '2008-09-14 19:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955080, 719133, 93094, '<td valign="top">Great shot thought I''d tone down the pumpkin just a bit in the brightness scale.  It draws the eye too much away from the product.</td>', 'Great shot thought I''d tone down the pumpkin just a bit in the brightness scale.  It draws the eye too much away from the product.', '2008-09-14 20:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955082, 719073, 93094, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and clarity on the can.  Congrats on a well-executed shot.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and clarity on the can.  Congrats on a well-executed shot.', '2008-09-14 20:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955125, 719082, 59029, '<td valign="top">but is it made of chocolate? :-)  Very nice clean shot, well-lit, slightly different pov may strengthen comp a bit, like a slight 3/4 shot. 7</td>', 'but is it made of chocolate? :-)  Very nice clean shot, well-lit, slightly different pov may strengthen comp a bit, like a slight 3/4 shot. 7', '2008-09-14 20:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955127, 718770, 59029, '<td valign="top">bwwhahahahahahahahahhaaa...great!  I would''ve put the lube on the bedside table, but the trail of clothes is wonderful.</td>', 'bwwhahahahahahahahahhaaa...great!  I would''ve put the lube on the bedside table, but the trail of clothes is wonderful.', '2008-09-14 21:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955176, 718838, 93094, '<td valign="top">Outstanding use of color accent.</td>', 'Outstanding use of color accent.', '2008-09-14 21:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955195, 718947, 93094, '<td valign="top">Very nice arrangement.  You get the message across well.</td>', 'Very nice arrangement.  You get the message across well.', '2008-09-14 22:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955205, 718999, 93094, '<td valign="top">At first glance its an outstanding shot but after looking at it a bit its hard to distinguish the individual components.  As a cyclist myself I tend to look deep at the gears, brakes, and other parts of a bike when viewing ads.  I really like the border lines you added to the shot.</td>', 'At first glance its an outstanding shot but after looking at it a bit its hard to distinguish the individual components.  As a cyclist myself I tend to look deep at the gears, brakes, and other parts of a bike when viewing ads.  I really like the border lines you added to the shot.', '2008-09-14 22:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955209, 718040, 93094, '<td valign="top">I like this but the canvas is a little tall.  The image goes below the fold when viewing on my desktop of 1280x800.</td>', 'I like this but the canvas is a little tall.  The image goes below the fold when viewing on my desktop of 1280x800.', '2008-09-14 22:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955210, 718838, 95208, '<td valign="top">Nice pic.</td>', 'Nice pic.', '2008-09-14 22:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955219, 717989, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Love the story.  Looks like something you''d see in a Christmas catalog.</td>', 'Very cute.  Love the story.  Looks like something you''d see in a Christmas catalog.', '2008-09-14 22:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955221, 718132, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best representations in the challenge.  The lighting is perfect for the item being sold.  Love the clarity and focus too.</td>', 'This is one of the best representations in the challenge.  The lighting is perfect for the item being sold.  Love the clarity and focus too.', '2008-09-14 22:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955224, 719073, 67697, '<td valign="top">This would make a great ad.  I love the lighting and focus on the can.  I like the reflection of your hand, but the hand itself is too light and blobby looking for my taste.  No worries tho, this will probably still do well.</td>', 'This would make a great ad.  I love the lighting and focus on the can.  I like the reflection of your hand, but the hand itself is too light and blobby looking for my taste.  No worries tho, this will probably still do well.', '2008-09-14 22:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955226, 719080, 93094, '<td valign="top">The title alone should win you the contest.</td>', 'The title alone should win you the contest.', '2008-09-14 22:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955228, 719127, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love this because it does look like something straight out of the cata log.  I love the lighting and clarity on all your items.  Cute touch with the name on the bag too.  Hope it ribbons!</td>', 'I love this because it does look like something straight out of the cata log.  I love the lighting and clarity on all your items.  Cute touch with the name on the bag too.  Hope it ribbons!', '2008-09-14 22:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955230, 719080, 39057, '<td valign="top">Crap ..my subscription expired...I''d give this a 10 !</td>', 'Crap ..my subscription expired...I''d give this a 10 !', '2008-09-14 22:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955234, 717357, 93094, '<td valign="top">Excellent...colors, sharpness, clarity, cropping...all excellent.</td>', 'Excellent...colors, sharpness, clarity, cropping...all excellent.', '2008-09-14 22:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955238, 718868, 93094, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen this on something other than a white background.  You do an excellent job of capturing the softness of the white on the product.  It may not have appeared that good with something like a black or blue background.</td>', 'I would like to have seen this on something other than a white background.  You do an excellent job of capturing the softness of the white on the product.  It may not have appeared that good with something like a black or blue background.', '2008-09-14 22:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4955270, 718174, 67237, '<td valign="top">good contrast, white spots in the towel are a bit too bright though. I think a tighter crop would have worked better.</td>', 'good contrast, white spots in the towel are a bit too bright though. I think a tighter crop would have worked better.', '2008-09-14 23:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
