(4955356, 719057, 90474, '<td valign="top">The background adds to the shot, but I think it''s a little high key for a product shot.  BUT, i seldom look at add for products of this type.</td>', 'The background adds to the shot, but I think it''s a little high key for a product shot.  BUT, i seldom look at add for products of this type.', '2008-09-15 00:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
