(4956327, 719080, 52549, '<td valign="top">I think it''s the best f..ing title ever ;-)) "Stuck an allen wrench in a birdbath and took pictures of it. I still don''t know why". LMAO!! Sorry, but every time I read that I go into fits of laughter (hope you don''t mind ;-)))))</td>', 'I think it''s the best f..ing title ever ;-)) "Stuck an allen wrench in a birdbath and took pictures of it. I still don''t know why". LMAO!! Sorry, but every time I read that I go into fits of laughter (hope you don''t mind ;-)))))', '2008-09-15 14:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
