(4956524, 719080, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the background and colors. Can''t get too excited about the subject, but the image is nice. Is that one of the lamest comments ever??? :/ But I do like it as an abstract.</td>', 'I like the background and colors. Can''t get too excited about the subject, but the image is nice. Is that one of the lamest comments ever??? :/ But I do like it as an abstract.', '2008-09-15 15:33:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4956556, 719120, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think having a plant in the basket would have brightened up the subject and helped to indicate it''s use and size. And I think a different background color, or a slight texture to the background would break up the monotone feel of the shot. Still you got a decent score. So what do I know? :P</td>', 'I think having a plant in the basket would have brightened up the subject and helped to indicate it''s use and size. And I think a different background color, or a slight texture to the background would break up the monotone feel of the shot. Still you got a decent score. So what do I know? :P', '2008-09-15 15:42:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4956569, 718971, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love the arrangement of the still life, with the smaller glasses in the back and that simple addition of the grapes in just the right place. I find the stone background distracting and the horizontal line across the center breaks up the flow of the image. I think you did a very nice job of lighting the glasses to bring out the detail of the cut design.</td>', 'I love the arrangement of the still life, with the smaller glasses in the back and that simple addition of the grapes in just the right place. I find the stone background distracting and the horizontal line across the center breaks up the flow of the image. I think you did a very nice job of lighting the glasses to bring out the detail of the cut design.', '2008-09-15 15:46:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4956575, 718838, 80459, '<td valign="top">Andy, I was hoping for the ribbon for you. Great picture! Down with soccer moms!!! I miss hang''n out.</td>', 'Andy, I was hoping for the ribbon for you. Great picture! Down with soccer moms!!! I miss hang''n out.', '2008-09-15 15:48:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4956584, 719078, 66384, '<td valign="top">Yummy! The texture and color are so real I really want to put my finger in that icing. I feel like the crop on the top is a little tight, but I think the product looks delicious. <br/> <br/>BTW, my daughter had a cupcake business for a while, and her photos were nowhere near this good.</td>', 'Yummy! The texture and color are so real I really want to put my finger in that icing. I feel like the crop on the top is a little tight, but I think the product looks delicious.  BTW, my daughter had a cupcake business for a while, and her photos were nowhere near this good.', '2008-09-15 15:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4956588, 719023, 80459, '<td valign="top">Hey, you made the camera page! Maybe I should shoot more with my point-n-shoot. LOL. Congrats on the Brown.</td>', 'Hey, you made the camera page! Maybe I should shoot more with my point-n-shoot. LOL. Congrats on the Brown.', '2008-09-15 15:52:44.000000', NULL, 0),
