(4956608, 719211, 66384, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! I love the heart bokeh. It really sets off the product with a bit of a subliminal message. Perhaps if there were just a little more image below the subject, the image would feel more balanced. I feel like I''m not seeing the whole picture, with the bottom edge of the border missing.</td>', 'Fabulous! I love the heart bokeh. It really sets off the product with a bit of a subliminal message. Perhaps if there were just a little more image below the subject, the image would feel more balanced. I feel like I''m not seeing the whole picture, with the bottom edge of the border missing.', '2008-09-15 15:58:08.000000', NULL, 0),
