(4957463, 718502, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hi Melissa,<br/> <br/>Excellent shot! A pity that it wasn''t rated better. I would had expected this to be in the region of 6+.<br/>The lighting, exposure, composition and framing is excellent!<br/> <br/>I can''t improve it much, except for the focus on the brand - Sandeman. It could had been sharper.<br/>Love the overall mood and feel to the shot.<br/> <br/>I would score it 9 out of 10.<br/> <br/>Btw.. Welcome to DPC. Keep up the good work. :)<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>Eric</td>', 'Hi Melissa, Excellent shot! A pity that it wasn''t rated better. I would had expected this to be in the region of 6+.The lighting, exposure, composition and framing is excellent! I can''t improve it much, except for the focus on the brand - Sandeman. It could had been sharper.Love the overall mood and feel to the shot. I would score it 9 out of 10. Btw.. Welcome to DPC. Keep up the good work. :) CheersEric', '2008-09-16 01:04:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4957502, 718980, 83026, '<td valign="top">It''s really creative. My favorite shot.</td>', 'It''s really creative. My favorite shot.', '2008-09-16 01:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
