(4959353, 719209, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hi Jaime,<br/>Lovely shot. Good composition and framing. I can''t fault this shot very much. It''s well setup and executed.<br/>If there''s only one thing I''ll point out, it''ll be to give it a little more "action"!<br/>A little sweat on the model would be a good start.<br/>Her right hand seemed to be holding (and not punching) the punching bag. Keep that away.<br/> <br/>On the whole, it''s an excellent shot!.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>eric</td>', 'Hi Jaime,Lovely shot. Good composition and framing. I can''t fault this shot very much. It''s well setup and executed.If there''s only one thing I''ll point out, it''ll be to give it a little more "action"!A little sweat on the model would be a good start.Her right hand seemed to be holding (and not punching) the punching bag. Keep that away. On the whole, it''s an excellent shot!. Cheerseric', '2008-09-17 07:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
