(4965765, 719150, 97163, '<td valign="top">The bottom ring looks really good. You needed more DOF to make the second ring look sharp, and yes, Hersheys look lousy this up close. <br/> <br/>The kiss is not pointy enough, perhaps you could have shaven it? Or maybe it was starting to melt with all the lighting? LOL</td>', 'The bottom ring looks really good. You needed more DOF to make the second ring look sharp, and yes, Hersheys look lousy this up close.  The kiss is not pointy enough, perhaps you could have shaven it? Or maybe it was starting to melt with all the lighting? LOL', '2008-09-20 14:54:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4965828, 719080, 30982, '<td valign="top">Probably the best an allen wrench has ever been presented.  Poor little thing lives a very uncelebrated life, I suspect, but they come in handy when you need one.  And, of course, you can never find the darn things when you need them.  Probably because they''re in birdbaths the world over... who knew?</td>', 'Probably the best an allen wrench has ever been presented.  Poor little thing lives a very uncelebrated life, I suspect, but they come in handy when you need one.  And, of course, you can never find the darn things when you need them.  Probably because they''re in birdbaths the world over... who knew?', '2008-09-20 15:57:15.000000', NULL, 0),
