(4966653, 719160, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hi Aaron,<br/>Apologies for taking so long with the comments.. :)<br/>Was busy setting up the next challenge shot.<br/> <br/>I love the feel of this shot. The lighting and all. In all, it is very well setup.<br/>Perhaps it''s the perspective/ angle that''s making the guitar look "fat".<br/>Give it a little more tilt.<br/> <br/>As it is, it''s great. I love it all the same. :)<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>Eric.</td>', 'Hi Aaron,Apologies for taking so long with the comments.. :)Was busy setting up the next challenge shot. I love the feel of this shot. The lighting and all. In all, it is very well setup.Perhaps it''s the perspective/ angle that''s making the guitar look "fat".Give it a little more tilt. As it is, it''s great. I love it all the same. :) CheersEric.', '2008-09-21 14:08:37.000000', NULL, 0),
